# T_SCRE: a deep nesting of screens: the location list, the
# contents of shelf A1, an item there opened for editing, its location
# field (twelve fields on), its location pick list with a letter jump, its
# memo edited and saved, and the form saved, back to the contents.
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN ENTER CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
S DEEPLOC
K F4
T C
S DEEPPICK
K ENTER PGDN F4
T First note.
S DEEPMEMO
K CTRL-S CTRL-S
S DEEPSAVE
K ESC ESC
